<title class="- topic/title ">Components in the bacnetAws module</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Components include services, folders and other model building
blocks associated with a module. You may drag them to a property or
wire sheet from a palette. The components of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">bacnetAWS</apiname> module support BACnet features running in a Supervisor PC.</shortdesc>
